# Report tables — rendered from the suite logs

## Table 1 — Data sources

| Source | Instrument | Price construction | Coverage |
|---|---|---|---|
| Kalshi | Moneyline (game winner) | Order-book mid at official start (candlesticks) post-cutoff; validated trade-reconstruction pre-cutoff | 10,069 of 10,118 master games |
| Polymarket Global | Moneyline | CLOB minute price at official start | 6,416 games |
| Polymarket US | Moneyline | Last trade at/before start from the public DCM tape | 2,631 four-way clean games |
| Sportsbooks | Moneyline | The Odds API historical closing consensus (~10.5 books/game), de-vigged; EU per-book incl. Pinnacle; 11 US books per-book | 5,437 games |
| Kalshi | Alternate-spread ladders | Book-mid / trade-recon per rung, settled under league-specific cover lines | 34,895 contracts |
| Kalshi | Totals ladders | Same construction; settlement-verified uniform convention | 45,224 contracts |
| Kalshi + books | Outrights 2020-26 | Monthly in-season snapshots, de-vigged fields | n=1614 sub-10c, 20 sport-season clusters |
| All three | Live panel | VPS collector, 5-min cadence, synchronized quotes | 818 games / 239,015 rows |
| ESPN | Outcomes + schedule | Scoreboard finals, cross-checked vs both platforms' settlements | anchor for everything above |

Joint three-way clean set: **5,333 games** across 386 dates.

## Table 2 — Power: minimum detectable effect by subgroup

| Group | n | dates | MDE K-P | MDE K-B | MDE P-B | verdict at δ=1e-3 |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| ALL | 5,333 | 386 | 0.48e-3 | 0.36e-3 | 0.51e-3 | powered |
| NHL | 1,384 | 214 | 0.53e-3 | 0.47e-3 | 0.64e-3 | powered |
| NBA | 1,284 | 211 | 0.71e-3 | 0.78e-3 | 0.95e-3 | powered |
| MLB | 1,240 | 99 | 0.50e-3 | 0.50e-3 | 0.57e-3 | powered |
| CFB | 721 | 84 | 2.52e-3 | 0.90e-3 | 2.74e-3 | UNDERPOWERED |
| WNBA | 426 | 169 | 2.37e-3 | 2.45e-3 | 1.62e-3 | UNDERPOWERED |
| NFL | 278 | 82 | 1.20e-3 | 1.34e-3 | 1.57e-3 | marginal |

Reading rule (locked): every subgroup null is quoted with its MDE. UNDERPOWERED leagues are 'consistent with equivalence but unable to detect it', never evidence for it. δ=1e-3 admits a systematic 3.16pt offset (ΔBrier=ε²).

